# Senren Banka — Thai Translation toolkit
# This repo sits inside the game directory, or anywhere below it — tools/paths.py
# walks up to find SenrenBanka.exe, so don't assume the two are the same folder.
# To avoid ever committing copyrighted game assets (or multi-GB archives), we
# IGNORE EVERYTHING by default and then un-ignore only our own tools + data.

# 1) ignore every top-level entry
/*

# 2) un-ignore safe top-level files
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/CONTEXT.md
!/LICENSE

# 2b) docs/ — ภาพประกอบ README (ภาพหน้าจอตัวติดตั้งที่เราเขียนเอง)
!/docs/

# 3) tools/  — our pipeline scripts + guide (NOT 3rd-party binaries)
!/tools/
/tools/FreeMote/
/tools/xdelta/
/tools/GARbro/
/tools/_dl/
/tools/**/__pycache__/
# The one exception to "no third-party binaries": tools/gui/ui/fonts/Sarabun-*.ttf.
# The OFL explicitly permits redistribution, OFL.txt ships beside them, and the
# GUI has to render Thai offline — a build without them falls back to whatever
# the machine happens to have.
#
# The installer's logo/icon/backdrop are CROPS OF THE GAME'S OWN ARTWORK, cut by
# tools/gui/build/make_logo.py and make_bg.py from a file you point them at. Those
# scripts already refuse to keep the source image here; the outputs slipped in
# anyway and are Yuzusoft's, not ours. Build them locally — assets.py returns None
# for each missing file and the app falls back to the plain Modernist design.
/tools/gui/ui/bg.png
/tools/gui/ui/icon.ico
/tools/gui/ui/logo@*.png

# 4) thai_work/ — keep only our translation data + dashboards
!/thai_work/
/thai_work/*
!/thai_work/th/
!/thai_work/glossary.csv
!/thai_work/PROGRESS.md
!/thai_work/PROGRESS_R18.md
!/thai_work/scenarios.json
!/thai_work/progress.json

# 5) within th/: keep Thai translations (idx -> th), drop the source dumps
#    (*.src.tsv contain the original JP + official EN text = copyrighted)
/thai_work/th/*.src.tsv

# ---- NEVER commit (redundant with the whitelist, kept explicit for safety) ----
# *.xp3 / *.xp3.orig                game archives (Yuzusoft assets, multi-GB)
# thai_work/strings_cn.csv          master CSV (contains JP + official EN)
# thai_work/fonts/                  base/merged/variant font binaries (build locally)
# thai_work/{json_cn,psb_cn,json_r18,psb_r18}/  decompiled scenarios (copyrighted)
# thai_work/{dataxp3,scnxp3}/       archives ที่แตกออกมา (ที่อยู่ใน tools/paths.py)
# thai_work/dist/                   ชุดติดตั้งที่ build ออกมา
